9,0:02:57.06,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,The Light of the RevolutionDialogue: 5,0:02:57.56,0:03:03.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what we've called you for more than ten years,  ever since we started searching for you.Dialogue: 5,0:03:04.10,0:03:08.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are the sole survivor of Ohara,  the country that fought the world.Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.34,0:03:15.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we ever found you, we would have done anything  to protect you from the government.Dialogue: 5,0:03:15.07,0:03:16.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So said our boss.Dialogue: 5,0:03:18.08,0:03:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your boss?Dialogue: 5,0:03:20.88,0:03:24.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Supreme Commander  of the Revolutionary Army, Dragon.Dialogue: 5,0:03:25.48,0:03:27.22,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's father...Dialogue: 5,0:03:29.12,0:03:30.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quite a twist of fate.Dialogue: 5,0:03:32.96,0:03:35.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ask you, one more time.Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.09,0:03:38.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please accept a meeting with our boss.Dialogue: 5,0:03:38.56,0:03:40.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We will escort you there.Dialogue: 5,0:03:40.03,0:03:44.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't... there is another place I must be.Dialogue: 5,0:03:44.50,0:03:47.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'll be fine without your protection.Dialogue: 5,0:03:49.37,0:03:52.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because I have my friends.Dialogue: 5,0:03:52.01,0:03:55.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're referring to  the Straw Hats, aren't you?Dialogue: 5,0:03:55.35,0:03:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you heard?Dialogue: 5,0:03:56.72,0:04:00.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, said to be the son of  Dragon-san, was in today's newspaper.Dialogue: 5,0:04:00.85,0:04:07.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He disappeared after the war,  but all of a sudden this happened.Dialogue: 5,0:04:07.24,0:04:10.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should show this article  to Nico Robin right away.Dialogue: 5,0:04:10.70,0:04:12.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She is probably worried about him.Dialogue: 5,0:04:12.76,0:04:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll still be out on the bridge.Dialogue: 5,0:04:16.74,0:04:20.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll pass many ruins on our way  to the end of the bridge.Dialogue: 5,0:04:20.64,0:04:25.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They were left behind as the people of this  country moved with the bridge's construction.Dialogue: 5,0:04:25.88,0:04:29.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Incidentally, this is the place where  construction began over 300 years ago.Dialogue: 5,0:04:30.15,0:04:32.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did they start building this bridge?Dialogue: 5,0:04:32.32,0:04:35.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By orders of the World Nobles,  the Celestial Dragons.Dialogue: 5,0:04:35.85,0:04:37.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Celestial Dragons?Dialogue: 5,0:04:37.22,0:04:44.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever reason they might have had, it doesn't  reduce the number of people who died as slaves here!Dialogue: 5,0:04:45.63,0:04:46.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good work.Dialogue: 5,0:04:47.60,0:04:49.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is for you, Robin-san.Dialogue: 5,0:04:50.94,0:04:52.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:04:53.04,0:04:55.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a relief, you're safe.Dialogue: 5,0:04:58.91,0:05:00.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 5,0:05:00.38,0:05:02.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you find something interesting in there?Dialogue: 5,0:05:04.72,0:05:05.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 5,0:05:26.97,0:05:29.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Straw-Hat-boy's wanted poster, isn't it?Dialogue: 5,0:05:29.74,0:05:31.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the one.Dialogue: 5,0:05:31.61,0:05:33.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the Pirate Hunter, Zoro.Dialogue: 5,0:05:33.91,0:05:34.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How should I know?!Dialogue: 5,0:05:34.78,0:05:37.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the Cat Burglar, Nami.Dialogue: 5,0:05:39.15,0:05:42.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the King of the Snipers, Sogeking.Dialogue: 5,0:05:42.82,0:05:44.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:05:44.22,0:05:46.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is... vyou?Dialogue: 5,0:05:46.36,0:05:46.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,NO!Dialogue: 5,0:05:46.93,0:05:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take a look here!Dialogue: 5,0:05:48.33,0:05:50.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now tell me which one is vyou!Dialogue: 5,0:05:50.46,0:05:54.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vyou say vyou're part of Straw-Hat-boy's  crew, but where's the proof?!Dialogue: 5,0:05:54.17,0:05:56.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm telling you,  I'm part of his crew!Dialogue: 5,0:05:56.57,0:06:00.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me what Luffy is doing  right now, you 'Kama King!Dialogue: 5,0:06:00.67,0:06:04.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The newspaper said you  were working with Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:06:04.48,0:06:06.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, is this vyou?Dialogue: 5,0:06:06.18,0:06:08.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No it's not!Dialogue: 5,0:06:08.61,0:06:11.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not me... but, it is.Dialogue: 5,0:06:13.19,0:06:15.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The name... is mine.Dialogue: 5,0:06:19.56,0:06:22.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this? An inner conflict?Dialogue: 5,0:06:25.93,0:06:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright... it's me!Dialogue: 5,0:06:29.50,0:06:32.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That disfigured wanted poster is definitely me!Dialogue: 5,0:06:32.34,0:06:33.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So please...Dialogue: 5,0:06:37.08,0:06:39.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. Looks nothing like vyou.Dialogue: 5,0:06:39.88,0:06:41.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then don't make me say it!Dialogue: 5,0:06:41.71,0:06:43.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You made me puke blood, idiot!Dialogue: 5,0:06:43.85,0:06:45.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vi can't do it.Dialogue: 5,0:06:45.35,0:06:50.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as there is even a 0.1% chance  that vyou are an agent from the government or Navy,Dialogue: 5,0:06:50.92,0:06:57.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vi will not give vyou a single scrap  of information on Straw-Hat-boy!Dialogue: 5,0:06:57.30,0:06:58.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get that.Dialogue: 5,0:06:58.93,0:07:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lend me a ship, then.Dialogue: 5,0:07:00.57,0:07:03.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll go to the meeting place,  Luffy will definitely be there.Dialogue: 5,0:07:03.37,0:07:04.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vi won't give vyou a ship either.Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.54,0:07:07.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine, then I'll just swim there!Dialogue: 5,0:07:08.14,0:07:09.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-What?!Dialogue: 5,0:07:09.71,0:07:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Such stubbornness is truly the mark  of one of Straw-Hat-boy's friends!Dialogue: 5,0:07:14.95,0:07:16.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vi have no choice.Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.68,0:07:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vyou have struck my heart.Dialogue: 5,0:07:18.08,0:07:22.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because of your stubbornness,  regarding Straw-Hat-boy, I can tell you...Dialogue: 5,0:07:24.82,0:07:27.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing!Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.93,0:07:32.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not telling?!   You really fooled us there!Dialogue: 5,0:07:33.33,0:07:34.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut it, you lot!Dialogue: 5,0:07:37.32,0:07:38.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it...Dialogue: 5,0:07:38.87,0:07:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He seems rather defeated, doesn't he?Dialogue: 5,0:07:41.24,0:07:45.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance!  Put it on, put it on... the Sweets Dress!Dialogue: 5,0:07:45.34,0:07:47.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not wearing that again!Dialogue: 5,0:07:47.31,0:07:48.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Back off!Dialogue: 5,0:07:49.18,0:07:53.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a man among men,  who likes real ladies!Dialogue: 5,0:07:53.49,0:07:55.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!Dialogue: 5,0:07:59.32,0:08:02.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, your name is Iva, right?Dialogue: 5,0:08:02.13,0:08:05.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've decided to act like a pirate  and steal one of your ships.Dialogue: 5,0:08:06.13,0:08:07.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Duel me!Dialogue: 5,0:08:08.53,0:08:09.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright then.Dialogue: 5,0:08:22.41,0:08:26.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vi'll tell vyou what  Straw-Hat-boy is doing, Twirly-boy.Dialogue: 5,0:08:27.65,0:08:29.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the change of heart?Dialogue: 5,0:08:30.32,0:08:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because the whole world already knows.Dialogue: 5,0:08:34.46,0:08:37.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder what he's planning.Dialogue: 5,0:08:37.83,0:08:39.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this today's paper?Dialogue: 5,0:08:39.60,0:08:41.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh, Luffy?!Dialogue: 5,0:08:41.53,0:08:44.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iva-san, we have a call from Baltigo.Dialogue: 5,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?Dialogue: 5,0:08:45.04,0:08:47.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please make your way  to the communications room.Dialogue: 5,0:08:48.17,0:08:50.28,Main-207+,,0,0,7,,Thanks to what happened during the war,Dialogue: 5,0:08:50.28,0:08:54.61,Main-207+,,0,0,7,,the whole world learned who vyour son is, Dragon.Dialogue: 5,0:08:54.65,0:08:57.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this causing problems amongst  the men of the Revolutionary Army?Dialogue: 5,0:08:58.82,0:09:04.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If anything, everyone seems relieved to find out  their enigmatic boss is a flesh-and-blood human being.Dialogue: 5,0:09:04.26,0:09:06.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not that it matters.Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.16,0:09:07.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy is no longer a child.Dialogue: 5,0:09:07.89,0:09:12.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still, I never would have imagined  that you two would team up.Dialogue: 5,0:09:12.43,0:09:15.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was an interesting twist of fate indeed.Dialogue: 5,0:09:16.94,0:09:22.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, Inazuma and Vi have a mountain of things to ask vyou.Dialogue: 5,0:09:22.90,0:09:25.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And to tell vyou about our jailbreak.Dialogue: 5,0:09:25.94,0:09:32.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet you do. Before long, the scattered  leaders of the world will need to reassemble.Dialogue: 5,0:09:32.98,0:09:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard's death will change the structure of  the government and the direction of the entire world.Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.66,0:09:39.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also,Dialogue: 5,0:09:39.96,0:09:43.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need to tell you about  what happened to Kuma.Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.56,0:09:46.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tell vme all about it.Dialogue: 5,0:09:46.73,0:09:50.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why has he become the government's servant?Dialogue: 5,0:09:51.14,0:09:54.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kuma Vi knew is gone.Dialogue: 5,0:09:54.47,0:09:57.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He attempted to kill vme.Dialogue: 5,0:09:58.41,0:10:01.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, Dragon,  have vyou seen today's newspaper?Dialogue: 5,0:10:01.65,0:10:05.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw-Hat-boy has surprised vus yet again!Dialogue: 5,0:10:05.05,0:10:07.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He is as unpredictable as his father.Dialogue: 5,0:10:07.72,0:10:11.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who'd have thought he'd do  something like that at Marineford?Dialogue: 5,0:10:15.86,0:10:19.56,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile... This is where  the Thousand Sunny is docked.Dialogue: 5,0:10:19.56,0:10:22.73,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The Sabaody Archipelago on the Grand Line.Dialogue: 5,0:10:22.73,0:10:25.67,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Grove 44.Dialogue: 5,0:10:25.67,0:10:29.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hand that ship over to us!Dialogue: 5,0:10:29.71,0:10:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It belongs to the son of Dragon the Revolutionary,  Straw Hat Luffy, doesn't it?!Dialogue: 5,0:10:35.08,0:10:39.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we turn it over to the Navy,  I'm sure they'll give us a hefty reward for it!Dialogue: 5,0:10:41.99,0:10:43.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're both in the same business,Dialogue: 5,0:10:44.56,0:10:48.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so if you hand it over quietly  I'm willing to give you half the reward.Dialogue: 5,0:10:48.86,0:10:50.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How about it, Flying Fish Riders?Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.76,0:10:52.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that? I'm handsome?Dialogue: 5,0:10:53.20,0:10:55.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you deaf?! I'm telling you  to give me the ship, dumbass!Dialogue: 5,0:10:57.07,0:10:59.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like hell I'm lettin' ya guys have it!Dialogue: 5,0:11:06.01,0:11:09.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you lot!  This handsome man is Duval.Dialogue: 5,0:11:09.85,0:11:12.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll never let a bunch of fools  like you get all the ladies...Dialogue: 5,0:11:13.39,0:11:15.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, steal the ship of my  saviors as long as I'm sexy...Dialogue: 5,0:11:15.99,0:11:17.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, as long as I'm here!Dialogue: 5,0:11:17.86,0:11:20.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You kept messing up that speech!Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.79,0:11:25.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as my eyes are black, I will not let  you lay one finger on the Young Masters' ship!Dialogue: 5,0:11:25.10,0:11:27.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you try to touch it then  I wanna touch a pretty lady...Dialogue: 5,0:11:27.60,0:11:29.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, I got that wrong!Dialogue: 5,0:11:29.63,0:11:32.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, don't think  I'll let you lay one finger on it!Dialogue: 5,0:11:32.47,0:11:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right, men?!Dialogue: 5,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Rose-some!Dialogue: 5,0:11:36.84,0:11:38.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Retreat!Dialogue: 5,0:11:39.91,0:11:42.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Duval-chin, you're so cool!Dialogue: 5,0:11:43.92,0:11:46.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A lady's declaration  of love for handsome me?Dialogue: 5,0:11:48.82,0:11:52.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I love you too!Dialogue: 5,0:11:52.09,0:11:55.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should take them to  the Mermaid Café first, right?Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.13,0:11:56.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's stylish!Dialogue: 5,0:11:57.46,0:12:01.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The most famous attraction on Fishman Island  is the Fishman Karate Dojo, Caimie.Dialogue: 5,0:12:01.87,0:12:05.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I promised the bone-guy  I'd introduce him to the Mermaid Princess!Dialogue: 5,0:12:05.70,0:12:08.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Duval-sama, she's ignoring you!Dialogue: 5,0:12:08.61,0:12:10.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's true. Never mind!Dialogue: 5,0:12:11.51,0:12:15.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shakki-chin ? They'll all get back  here by following the vivre card, right?Dialogue: 5,0:12:16.08,0:12:19.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that Luffy-chin is alright  because of that article today, too.Dialogue: 5,0:12:20.22,0:12:21.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes,Dialogue: 5,0:12:22.09,0:12:24.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it might take some time.Dialogue: 5,0:12:24.46,0:12:27.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At least we know that Ray-san  safely met up with Monkey-chan.Dialogue: 5,0:12:30.80,0:12:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Until they come back, we have to do  everything we can to protect this ship.Dialogue: 5,0:12:34.50,0:12:37.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's no problem  as long as we're here, Sis!Dialogue: 5,0:12:37.80,0:12:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be it the Navy or whoever...Dialogue: 5,0:12:40.31,0:12:44.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't lettin' anyone steal the ship!Dialogue: 5,0:12:44.88,0:12:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.11,0:12:52.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Duval-sama, it's awful! Kuma! Kuma is here!Dialogue: 5,0:12:53.22,0:12:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuma: BearDialogue: 5,0:12:53.22,0:12:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A bear?! There are no bears on this island.Dialogue: 5,0:12:57.06,0:12:57.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 5,0:13:05.13,0:13:08.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Bartholomew Kuma of the Seven Warlords!Dialogue: 5,0:13:24.05,0:13:25.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't panic.Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.75,0:13:29.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This man came to speak  to Ray-san earlier.Dialogue: 5,0:13:30.89,0:13:32.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's an ally.Dialogue: 5,0:13:33.06,0:13:34.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right?Dialogue: 5,0:13:40.87,0:13:44.87,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Sandy Island  on the Grand Line.Dialogue: 5,0:13:44.87,0:13:47.44,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The Land of Sand, Arabasta Kingdom.Dialogue: 5,0:13:48.51,0:13:51.18,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,In the capital city of Alubarna.Dialogue: 5,0:13:54.28,0:13:56.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the situation with the pirates?Dialogue: 5,0:13:56.58,0:13:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We chased them off.  The city suffered minimal damage.Dialogue: 5,0:13:59.52,0:14:03.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're increasing security  for all the ports in the country.Dialogue: 5,0:14:03.15,0:14:04.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't let our guard down.Dialogue: 5,0:14:04.99,0:14:09.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wish that all pirates  were like Luffy-kun...Dialogue: 5,0:14:09.73,0:14:11.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but that obviously isn't the case.Dialogue: 5,0:14:12.23,0:14:14.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, Your Majesty.Dialogue: 5,0:14:14.13,0:14:16.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you see the newspaper this morning?Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.27,0:14:18.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course.Dialogue: 5,0:14:20.41,0:14:23.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These things on Luffy-san's arm... Numbers?Dialogue: 5,0:14:23.98,0:14:25.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Markings?Dialogue: 5,0:14:25.38,0:14:27.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or is it just to look cool?Dialogue: 5,0:14:27.71,0:14:30.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That can't be it, right?   I mean, it's Luffy-san.Dialogue: 5,0:14:38.26,0:14:43.83,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, on the Grand Line,  on a certain island, in a certain town.Dialogue: 5,0:14:47.53,0:14:51.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! What is he  doing on this island?!Dialogue: 5,0:14:51.34,0:14:52.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ssssh! He'll hear us!Dialogue: 5,0:14:53.51,0:14:56.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's only been three  weeks since the war.Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.94,0:15:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He should still be recovering  after his near-death experience.Dialogue: 5,0:15:03.92,0:15:07.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's he up to now?Dialogue: 5,0:15:07.25,0:15:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must have some sort of plan.Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.91,0:15:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If not, he's lost his mind.Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.89,0:15:14.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that what you think, Daz?Dialogue: 5,0:15:15.96,0:15:21.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is wounded.  Do you really think wounds heal easily?Dialogue: 5,0:15:23.33,0:15:26.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You cheeky bastard.   You trying to be sarcastic?Dialogue: 5,0:15:29.44,0:15:31.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My wounds are long since healed.Dialogue: 5,0:15:32.41,0:15:37.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To prove it, I'll return to the New World soon.  So full of memories.Dialogue: 5,0:15:38.85,0:15:40.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you coming with me?Dialogue: 5,0:15:42.59,0:15:43.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.Dialogue: 5,0:15:45.06,0:15:48.46,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,A certain deserted island on the Grand Line.Dialogue: 5,0:15:53.33,0:15:55.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ever since you were arrested,Dialogue: 5,0:15:55.77,0:15:59.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been so worried that I couldn't sleep at night.  I was planning to break you out!Dialogue: 5,0:15:59.70,0:16:04.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We sailed all over the seas,  everyday we were covered in wounds.Dialogue: 5,0:16:04.58,0:16:09.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then all of a sudden the newspapers that said you,  who were supposed to be in jail, had became a hero!Dialogue: 5,0:16:13.89,0:16:15.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy!Dialogue: 5,0:16:15.65,0:16:17.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've been looking for you!Dialogue: 5,0:16:19.09,0:16:23.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We always trusted and  followed you so we thought:Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.39,0:16:27.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Do you see that, New World?!  That's our Captain!"Dialogue: 5,0:16:28.27,0:16:31.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys! You really had  that much faith in me?!Dialogue: 5,0:16:31.70,0:16:33.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I really wanted to see you guys!Dialogue: 5,0:16:33.94,0:16:36.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy!Dialogue: 5,0:16:42.75,0:16:44.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't you guys...Dialogue: 5,0:16:44.98,0:16:47.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,abandon Buggy?Dialogue: 5,0:16:58.50,0:17:01.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And with that, men!Dialogue: 5,0:17:02.43,0:17:06.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am the first mate  of the Buggy Pirates, Mohji!Dialogue: 5,0:17:06.07,0:17:08.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Mohji!Dialogue: 5,0:17:09.64,0:17:11.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am the chief of staff, Cabaji!Dialogue: 5,0:17:11.91,0:17:14.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Cabaji!Dialogue: 5,0:17:14.65,0:17:19.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And this is my partner, Richie!Dialogue: 5,0:17:20.15,0:17:22.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Richie!Dialogue: 5,0:17:25.96,0:17:30.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe that stuff  written in the news was actually true!Dialogue: 5,0:17:30.56,0:17:35.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All those guys are notorious criminals  with high bounties, I've seen their posters before.Dialogue: 5,0:17:36.60,0:17:41.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, they're my partners in crime  from Impel Down, you see!Dialogue: 5,0:17:41.31,0:17:47.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, right... Hey, Alvida,  want to see something amazing?Dialogue: 5,0:17:47.11,0:17:48.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ta-daah!Dialogue: 5,0:17:49.91,0:17:51.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't this...Dialogue: 5,0:17:51.52,0:17:55.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!  Captain John's treasure mark?!Dialogue: 5,0:17:55.32,0:17:56.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed it is!Dialogue: 5,0:17:56.55,0:17:59.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing! How did you  get your hands on it?Dialogue: 5,0:18:00.96,0:18:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat kid  had it with him!Dialogue: 5,0:18:06.26,0:18:09.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The winds of this world aren't  blowing to the west or east,Dialogue: 5,0:18:09.80,0:18:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they're all blowing in my direction!Dialogue: 5,0:18:15.14,0:18:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buggy!Dialogue: 5,0:18:18.14,0:18:21.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A Carrier Bat has come with a message  from the government, it's addressed to you!Dialogue: 5,0:18:21.55,0:18:23.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! How'd they know I was here?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:25.22,0:18:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is...Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.39,0:18:30.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is an astonishing message indeed!Dialogue: 5,0:18:30.22,0:18:32.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go and read it before I do!Dialogue: 5,0:18:34.59,0:18:38.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swear, this man always seems  to be the topic of our discussions.Dialogue: 5,0:18:38.23,0:18:43.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything seemed to be explained when we found out  Straw Hat Luffy is the grandson of Garp. But now...Dialogue: 5,0:18:43.23,0:18:47.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is his connection to Rayleigh?Dialogue: 5,0:18:47.24,0:18:50.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I doubt he wants to take center  stage after all this time.Dialogue: 5,0:18:51.14,0:18:53.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jinbe finally turned against us as well.Dialogue: 5,0:18:53.85,0:18:59.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His position in the Seven Warlords  was a sign of peace with his species.Dialogue: 5,0:18:59.08,0:19:00.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quite a shame.Dialogue: 5,0:19:00.62,0:19:04.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Three Great Powers are  completely out of balance now.Dialogue: 5,0:19:04.86,0:19:08.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How should we fill the three missing  positions in the Seven Warlords of the Sea?Dialogue: 5,0:19:08.49,0:19:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We ought to wait and keep an eye  on developments in the New World.Dialogue: 5,0:19:11.96,0:19:15.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chances are, the power balance amongst  the pirates will change as well.Dialogue: 5,0:19:15.67,0:19:19.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must scout out  the most powerful ones.Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.14,0:19:23.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard has already made  his move in the New World.Dialogue: 5,0:19:23.44,0:19:29.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He took out one of the rookies with  a bounty exceeding one hundred million.Dialogue: 5,0:19:29.00,0:19:33.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's familiar with Whitebeard's turf, after all.Dialogue: 5,0:19:35.19,0:19:40.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess we could say that he has a headstart  for a position amongst the Four Emperors.Dialogue: 5,0:19:40.93,0:19:47.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No human in history has ever  eaten two Devil Fruits before.Dialogue: 5,0:19:47.20,0:19:52.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our only hope to stop his attacks  would be the Four Emperors,Dialogue: 5,0:19:53.04,0:19:57.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or we could call Marco the Phoenix  and the other remnants of Whitebeard's crew.Dialogue: 5,0:19:58.88,0:20:01.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The D's are always troublesome.Dialogue: 5,0:20:01.75,0:20:03.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Portgas was one of them too.Dialogue: 5,0:20:03.92,0:20:09.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These days, that name is  showing up a little too often.Dialogue: 5,0:20:12.62,0:20:17.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I tried to talk him out of it,  but Garp has practically resigned his position.Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.80,0:20:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, he keeps his title  and remains in the Navy,Dialogue: 5,0:20:23.56,0:20:27.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in order to educate the young marines.Dialogue: 5,0:20:27.49,0:20:33.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you intend to resign from your position  as Fleet Admiral of the Navy, at least do the same,Dialogue: 5,0:20:33.24,0:20:35.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sengoku.Dialogue: 5,0:20:35.01,0:20:35.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Very well.Dialogue: 5,0:20:36.61,0:20:39.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I accept that request.Dialogue: 5,0:20:39.05,0:20:41.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It might be nice to spend  my retirement that way.Dialogue: 5,0:20:45.02,0:20:52.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The two men who have led the Navy from the front  lines since Roger's era are leaving the battlefield.Dialogue: 5,0:20:52.23,0:20:54.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a pretty major event.Dialogue: 5,0:20:54.60,0:20:59.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Taking into account all the escapees  from Impel Down Level Six,Dialogue: 5,0:20:59.87,0:21:03.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there are a lot of legendary  pirates still out there.Dialogue: 5,0:21:05.11,0:21:08.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Newgate was the greatest of them all.Dialogue: 5,0:21:10.62,0:21:14.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that the Pirate Era  is about to be born anew,Dialogue: 5,0:21:14.19,0:21:18.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,oldtimers like us shouldn't  be leading the Navy.Dialogue: 5,0:21:18.12,0:21:21.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Justice lies in values which  cannot transcend the generations.Dialogue: 5,0:21:24.06,0:21:26.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It pains me to hear you say this.Dialogue: 5,0:21:26.13,0:21:28.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Kong-san.Dialogue: 5,0:21:28.13,0:21:31.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Considering who should be  the next Navy Fleet Admiral...Dialogue: 5,0:21:31.27,0:21:34.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd like to recommend  Aokiji for the position.Dialogue: 5,0:21:35.87,0:21:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he survived.Dialogue: 5,0:21:37.81,0:21:39.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quite impressive.Dialogue: 5,0:21:40.38,0:21:44.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you heard?  Straw Hat caused another scene.Dialogue: 5,0:21:44.32,0:21:45.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard.Dialogue: 5,0:21:45.28,0:21:50.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The great war just barely ended,  and now the sixteen bells?Dialogue: 5,0:21:50.99,0:21:53.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could this be some sort of message?Dialogue: 5,0:21:54.96,0:21:56.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who knows?Dialogue: 5,0:21:56.83,0:21:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But anyway, what about my transfer?Dialogue: 5,0:22:00.03,0:22:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll discuss it with Sengoku-san.Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.84,0:22:05.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But are you serious?Dialogue: 5,0:22:05.90,0:22:09.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say anything  like this as a joke.Dialogue: 5,0:22:09.17,0:22:15.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that's true, but G-5 isn't  the sort of place people go to voluntarily.Dialogue: 5,0:22:15.51,0:22:18.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The place has its problems.Dialogue: 5,0:22:19.65,0:22:23.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fifth division  of the Navy's Grand Line unit.Dialogue: 5,0:22:23.86,0:22:26.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Basically, you want to  go to the New World?Dialogue: 5,0:22:26.72,0:22:30.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd like to keep my targets close.Dialogue: 5,0:22:32.61,0:22:35.73,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,The power known as Haki...Dialogue: 5,0:22:35.73,0:22:38.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt this is one of its forms.Dialogue: 5,0:22:39.64,0:22:43.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must have been awakened after some sort of  trauma you suffered during the battle.Dialogue: 5,0:22:43.44,0:22:48.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Under normal circumstances,  it will only develop after extensive training.Dialogue: 5,0:22:48.28,0:22:51.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haki... That's what this is?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:51.55,0:22:55.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All marines ranked Vice-Admiral  or higher can control it.Dialogue: 5,0:22:55.95,0:22:56.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously?Dialogue: 5,0:22:56.79,0:22:59.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can feel the presence  of other people so strongly.Dialogue: 5,0:22:59.82,0:23:01.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just too much!Dialogue: 5,0:23:01.66,0:23:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two are Garp's apprentices, right?Dialogue: 5,0:23:04.40,0:23:06.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have him teach you  how to control it.Dialogue: 5,0:23:06.13,0:23:07.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doctor!Dialogue: 5,0:23:07.90,0:23:10.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will I be able to learn it too?Dialogue: 5,0:23:10.00,0:23:11.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How should I know?Dialogue: 5,0:23:13.20,0:23:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it! It feels like you're  a step ahead of me now!Dialogue: 5,0:23:18.51,0:23:21.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know how it happened either.Dialogue: 5,0:23:22.75,0:23:24.62,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,This is inconceivable!Dialogue: 5,0:23:25.22,0:23:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the great war that just ended, we found out  he was step-brother to the deceased Portgas D. Ace,Dialogue: 5,0:23:30.12,0:23:32.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the son of Dragon the Revolutionary,Dialogue: 5,0:23:32.59,0:23:38.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and last, but not least,  the grandchild of our own Vice-Admiral Garp!Dialogue: 5,0:23:38.26,0:23:41.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pirate, Monkey D. Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:23:41.73,0:23:45.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His whereabouts were unknown  in the days after the war...Dialogue: 5,0:23:45.00,0:23:48.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but sure enough, he was alive!Dialogue: 5,0:23:48.97,0:23:51.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He appeared here again, at Navy HQ!Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.08,0:23:54.81,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Sink that warship!Dialogue: 5,0:24:03.32,0:24:06.12,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,No way... Is that the living legend,Dialogue: 5,0:24:06.72,0:24:09.13,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,former first-mate of the Roger Pirates,Dialogue: 5,0:24:09.13,0:24:11.53,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,The Dark King, Silvers Rayleigh?!Dialogue: 5,0:24:25.94,0:24:28.15,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,They're circling once around the entire island.Dialogue: 5,0:24:28.15,0:24:30.88,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,It's like a funeral at sea!Dialogue: 5,0:24:42.63,0:24:45.10,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Launch a concentrated attack from all directions!Dialogue: 5,0:25:05.35,0:25:06.92,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Now, go wild!Dialogue: 5,0:25:08.09,0:25:08.75,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Right!Dialogue: 5,0:25:10.22,0:25:12.39,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Capture Straw Hat!Dialogue: 5,0:25:12.86,0:25:16.26,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber WhipDialogue: 5,0:25:24.97,0:25:27.51,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,What's he going to do  with the Ox Bell?!Dialogue: 5,0:26:04.64,0:26:06.31,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,This will make a great shot!Dialogue: 5,0:26:28.93,0:26:30.50,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,After him! Don't let him escape!Dialogue: 5,0:26:30.50,0:26:32.70,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,There he goes.Dialogue: 5,0:26:33.24,0:26:34.87,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,What was that all about?Dialogue: 5,0:26:34.87,0:26:38.71,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,The Dark King Rayleigh, and even Jinbe  from the Seven Warlords of the Sea...Dialogue: 5,0:26:38.71,0:26:40.38,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Both of them were with Straw Hat?Dialogue: 5,0:26:40.38,0:26:43.61,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh was on the Pirate King's crew.Dialogue: 5,0:26:43.61,0:26:46.12,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Is Straw Hat supposed to  be Roger's successor?Dialogue: 5,0:26:46.12,0:26:50.62,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! Straw Hat is  Dragon's son! That can't be.Dialogue: 5,0:26:51.39,0:26:52.86,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,In any case, this...Dialogue: 5,0:26:53.49,0:26:55.06,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,is big news!Dialogue: 5,0:27:14.38,0:27:17.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People all around the world  have already seen this article!Dialogue: 5,0:27:17.52,0:27:22.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're reading how we let Straw Hat  slip through our fingers!Dialogue: 5,0:27:22.19,0:27:23.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a complete disgrace!Dialogue: 5,0:27:23.59,0:27:26.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we try to interpret  Straw Hat's actions,Dialogue: 5,0:27:26.66,0:27:32.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it seems to be a memorial to his brother, Whitebeard,  and everyone else who lost their lives during the war.Dialogue: 5,0:27:32.66,0:27:35.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Circling the island and his silent  prayer suggests that interpretation.Dialogue: 5,0:27:36.07,0:27:40.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's a well-known fact that you only ring  the bell twice on such occasions.Dialogue: 5,0:27:40.10,0:27:41.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yet he rung it sixteen times!Dialogue: 5,0:27:41.91,0:27:46.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sixteen rings must be  a challenge to us!Dialogue: 5,0:27:47.31,0:27:51.08,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,These are the waters of the Grand Line.Dialogue: 5,0:27:52.38,0:27:55.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this, you guys.  I forced you to make this long journey.Dialogue: 5,0:27:55.32,0:27:57.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's fine. We're used to  going on expeditions.Dialogue: 5,0:27:57.89,0:27:59.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing over there?Dialogue: 5,0:27:59.79,0:28:02.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're keeping watch over you  to make sure you're alright.Dialogue: 5,0:28:02.39,0:28:04.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an order from the Snake Princess.Dialogue: 5,0:28:04.66,0:28:09.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Snake Princess got too  excited earlier, so she collapsed.Dialogue: 5,0:28:10.23,0:28:13.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we're keeping close watch on you.Dialogue: 5,0:28:15.77,0:28:19.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they'll get the message?Dialogue: 5,0:28:20.61,0:28:23.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as they read the article,  they should understand it.Dialogue: 5,0:28:23.05,0:28:26.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The key is that it's not  the sort of thing you'd normally do.Dialogue: 5,0:28:26.22,0:28:27.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, will you stop that?Dialogue: 5,0:28:27.45,0:28:31.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was one man  who seemed rather dense, though.Dialogue: 5,0:28:31.19,0:28:33.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure he'll  figure it out somehow.Dialogue: 5,0:28:34.02,0:28:36.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It should be understood  by all of them.Dialogue: 5,0:28:36.63,0:28:38.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what I believe.Dialogue: 5,0:28:39.53,0:28:41.73,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The sky above the Grand Line.Dialogue: 5,0:28:47.07,0:28:50.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's it? I got it, Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:28:51.31,0:28:55.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I understand! Really? So that's it?Dialogue: 5,0:28:55.95,0:28:59.62,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,East Blue, on top of the enormous bridge.Dialogue: 5,0:29:05.16,0:29:07.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see, so that's how it is.Dialogue: 5,0:29:07.29,0:29:10.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it, Robin-san ?Dialogue: 5,0:29:13.10,0:29:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, Luffy.Dialogue: 5,0:29:19.40,0:29:21.87,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Kamabakka Drag Queendom.Dialogue: 5,0:29:29.05,0:29:32.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's what you meant, Luffy?Dialogue: 5,0:29:32.12,0:29:33.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 5,0:29:37.52,0:29:40.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ruins of the Shikkearu Kingdom.Dialogue: 5,0:29:41.13,0:29:42.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, have you read it yet?Dialogue: 5,0:29:42.89,0:29:44.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My hands are getting tired.Dialogue: 5,0:29:44.90,0:29:46.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait just a little longer!Dialogue: 5,0:29:46.73,0:29:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There must be something here.Dialogue: 5,0:29:48.33,0:29:51.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy wouldn't do something like this!Dialogue: 5,0:29:51.64,0:29:55.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fact that Rayleigh was with him means  that it must have been his idea!Dialogue: 5,0:29:55.07,0:29:56.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's something hidden here!Dialogue: 5,0:29:57.91,0:30:01.18,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The Future Kingdom of Baldimore.Dialogue: 5,0:30:05.05,0:30:07.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright then.Dialogue: 5,0:30:07.08,0:30:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm beat!Dialogue: 5,0:30:11.36,0:30:12.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Old guy!Dialogue: 5,0:30:28.61,0:30:29.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see!Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.88,0:30:36.58,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Bowin ArchipelagoDialogue: 5,0:30:36.58,0:30:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it now'n, Usoppun?Dialogue: 5,0:30:39.36,0:30:41.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger that, Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:30:44.66,0:30:47.49,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The Sky Island of Weatheria.Dialogue: 5,0:30:49.86,0:30:51.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get it.Dialogue: 5,0:30:51.90,0:30:56.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, he decided that all on his own  without taking our feelings into account!Dialogue: 5,0:30:56.77,0:30:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Girl, you're gonna get caught!Dialogue: 5,0:31:01.21,0:31:03.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teena Gaina Kingdom.Dialogue: 5,0:31:01.21,0:31:03.41,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Te, nagai na": "Your hands sure are long."Dialogue: 5,0:31:13.58,0:31:17.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's almost time for the show.  Try to look lively.Dialogue: 5,0:31:17.12,0:31:18.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here you go.Dialogue: 5,0:31:20.46,0:31:21.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san !Dialogue: 5,0:31:21.69,0:31:23.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your patience!Dialogue: 5,0:31:23.09,0:31:27.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we have the rarest specimen in the world,  a moving skeleton! Have a look!Dialogue: 5,0:31:34.30,0:31:36.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?Dialogue: 5,0:31:38.84,0:31:41.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I understand, Luffy-san.Dialogue: 5,0:31:46.08,0:31:50.45,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The news of the incident caused by  Straw Hat Luffy races around the world.Dialogue: 5,0:31:51.42,0:31:54.66,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Even here, in the New World.Dialogue: 5,0:31:54.66,0:31:58.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he's still alive, huh? Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:31:58.96,0:32:02.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sixteen bells at Marineford  to ring in the new era.Dialogue: 5,0:32:03.73,0:32:05.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the Ox Bell, anyway?Dialogue: 5,0:32:07.07,0:32:08.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Ox Bell is...Dialogue: 5,0:32:09.87,0:32:15.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a sacred bell that was carried by a warship named Ox Lloyds. The ship served the Navy in the distant past.Dialogue: 5,0:32:16.75,0:32:21.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At the end of every year,  it is rung eight times in gratitude for the past year,Dialogue: 5,0:32:21.59,0:32:24.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and another eight times as  a prayer of good luck for the new one.Dialogue: 5,0:32:25.02,0:32:29.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, ringing the bell sixteen  times is a Marine tradition.Dialogue: 5,0:32:29.09,0:32:31.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is the sixteen bells.Dialogue: 5,0:32:33.23,0:32:35.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But this is not  the right time for it.Dialogue: 5,0:32:35.57,0:32:40.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words, he rang the bell to declare the end,  and beginning, of an era.Dialogue: 5,0:32:40.04,0:32:46.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he's saying that "Whitebeard's era is over,  and I will create a new one," huh?Dialogue: 5,0:32:46.84,0:32:49.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he didn't have that kind of will,Dialogue: 5,0:32:49.11,0:32:54.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,why would he willingly return to the place  where he'd relive the pain of losing his brother?Dialogue: 5,0:32:56.45,0:32:58.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That guy really gets on my nerves!Dialogue: 5,0:32:58.79,0:33:06.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,True, the war made him stand out from us other  rookies with bounties over a hundred million,Dialogue: 5,0:33:06.26,0:33:11.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I ain't a weakling that will  let him hold that advantage for long!Dialogue: 5,0:33:13.97,0:33:18.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had expected more  from this New World.Dialogue: 5,0:33:18.98,0:33:21.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with these spineless weaklings?!Dialogue: 5,0:33:21.38,0:33:23.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, give us a break!Dialogue: 5,0:33:23.15,0:33:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody here did anything to harm you!Dialogue: 5,0:33:25.95,0:33:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were just going to  leave this sea!Dialogue: 5,0:33:29.12,0:33:31.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please let us live and  go back to Paradise!Dialogue: 5,0:33:31.89,0:33:35.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paradise? You mean your warm house?Dialogue: 5,0:33:35.76,0:33:41.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys only just came to this sea,  so you don't know how terrifying it truly is!Dialogue: 5,0:33:48.71,0:33:49.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat?Dialogue: 5,0:33:49.94,0:33:52.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, it seems he caused another ruckus.Dialogue: 5,0:33:52.54,0:33:55.01,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,There's no need to panic.Dialogue: 5,0:33:55.01,0:33:58.75,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Only the final checkmate decides the winner.Dialogue: 5,0:34:00.08,0:34:01.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?!Dialogue: 5,0:34:01.08,0:34:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father! The ship...Dialogue: 5,0:34:03.39,0:34:06.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's left the water surface,  and is floating into the sky!Dialogue: 5,0:34:06.26,0:34:08.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 5,0:34:08.03,0:34:11.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is going on?  What is the meaning of this?!Dialogue: 5,0:34:11.26,0:34:12.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Steer us back on course!Dialogue: 5,0:34:12.76,0:34:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father! Something is  descending upon us from the sky!Dialogue: 5,0:34:18.70,0:34:22.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, wait! We're the ones  being sucked toward it!Dialogue: 5,0:34:27.91,0:34:29.81,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,I am truly sorry.Dialogue: 5,0:34:31.92,0:34:34.28,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Could you please repeat that?Dialogue: 5,0:34:34.28,0:34:36.49,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,I couldn't quite hear you.Dialogue: 5,0:34:36.49,0:34:38.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Brownbeard!Dialogue: 5,0:34:38.29,0:34:42.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pirate with a bounty  of over eighty million, Brownbeard-sama !Dialogue: 5,0:34:43.59,0:34:47.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd best remember my name well.  This is my turf!Dialogue: 5,0:34:47.66,0:34:50.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've done something awful to my adorable underlings.Dialogue: 5,0:34:50.93,0:34:53.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take it out of your hide!Dialogue: 5,0:34:53.20,0:34:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? It was such a ridiculous name,  I was sure I'd misheard.Dialogue: 5,0:34:58.91,0:35:03.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me make two things clear.  First of all, I hate jokes.Dialogue: 5,0:35:03.18,0:35:04.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jokes?!Dialogue: 5,0:35:04.72,0:35:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Furthermore...Dialogue: 5,0:35:08.42,0:35:12.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The shadow of death looms  over you on this day.Dialogue: 5,0:35:20.56,0:35:25.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is the log pose really  pointing toward that island?Dialogue: 5,0:35:25.14,0:35:28.98,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,The lightningbolts are raining down!Dialogue: 5,0:35:28.98,0:35:30.97,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,This is ridiculous!Dialogue: 5,0:35:36.68,0:35:39.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to  land on this island?!Dialogue: 5,0:35:40.72,0:35:44.92,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Bold men who set foot into  the New World for the first time...Dialogue: 5,0:35:45.96,0:35:48.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reverend! Someone is coming toward us!Dialogue: 5,0:35:49.53,0:35:50.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is that?Dialogue: 5,0:35:50.53,0:35:55.47,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,all say the same thing about  the first half of the Grand Line...Dialogue: 5,0:35:55.47,0:35:57.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Young'uns up there.Dialogue: 5,0:35:58.44,0:36:01.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's this old lady?Dialogue: 5,0:36:01.14,0:36:05.24,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,"That ocean was Paradise!"Dialogue: 5,0:36:07.18,0:36:10.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want an umbrella?Dialogue: 5,0:36:10.88,0:36:14.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we stay on this sea, we won't last.   No matter how many lives we have!Dialogue: 5,0:36:14.82,0:36:19.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We just want to go back  to Paradise! Please!Dialogue: 5,0:36:19.92,0:36:22.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You make me sick.Dialogue: 5,0:36:23.73,0:36:28.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyone who doesn't have  the resolve to risk their lives...Dialogue: 5,0:36:28.83,0:36:33.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,has no place on this sea!Dialogue: 5,0:36:38.48,0:36:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll take the lead in no time at all!Dialogue: 5,0:36:41.65,0:36:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So watch your back and wait, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:49.72,Captions,,0,0,0,,East Blue: Atop an Enormous BridgeDialogue: 1,0:02:44.74,0:02:49.72,Captions,,0,0,0,,East Blue: Atop an Enormous BridgeDialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:26.61,Captions,,0,0,0,,Grand Line Momoiro Island, Kamabakka KingdomDialogue: 1,0:05:22.90,0:05:26.61,Captions,,0,0,0,,Grand Line Momoiro Island, Kamabakka KingdomDialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:54.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,Grand Line Isle of White Earth, BaltigoDialogue: 1,0:08:47.54,0:08:54.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,Grand Line Isle of White Earth, BaltigoDialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:22.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,White Transponder Snail (Emits a Signal  That Blocks Call Interception)Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.73,0:09:22.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,White Transponder Snail (Emits a Signal  That Blocks Call Interception)Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.99,0:20:17.96,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Holy Land Mary Geoise, Red LineDialogue: 1,0:20:12.99,0:20:17.96,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Holy Land Mary Geoise, Red LineDialogue: 0,0:20:18.76,0:20:29.54,Captions,,0,0,0,,World Government Military Commander in Chief KongDialogue: 1,0:20:18.76,0:20:29.54,Captions,,0,0,0,,World Government Military Commander in Chief KongDialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:35.73,Captions,,0,0,0,,Navy Headquarters - Medical WardDialogue: 1,0:22:31.06,0:22:35.73,Captions,,0,0,0,,Navy Headquarters - Medical WardDialogue: 0,0:23:21.31,0:23:24.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,Proceedings RoomDialogue: 1,0:23:21.31,0:23:24.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,Proceedings RoomDialogue: 1,0:23:41.67,0: