6,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,Let's move on without any fearsDialogue: 0,0:01:25.97,0:01:27.83,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,Please don't forgetDialogue: 0,0:01:29.87,0:01:37.11,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,The great, wide, distant skyDialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:39.88,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,that we looked up to on that dayDialogue: 0,0:01:40.01,0:01:45.02,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,has yet to be taintedDialogue: 0,0:01:45.05,0:01:48.45,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,We've come quite a long wayDialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:52.39,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,all carrying the vows we made within our heartsDialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:54.99,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to fearDialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:59.40,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,We all have burdens we must carryDialogue: 0,0:01:59.57,0:02:01.87,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,The sun risesDialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:06.84,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,and it brightens everything, even my sadnessDialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:09.24,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,I believeDialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:15.68,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,in the future where we'll come together as oneDialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:19.28,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,Let's go find it togetherDialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:23.09,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,There's nobody that can take your placeDialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:25.22,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,Please don't forget